flowchart TB
    Client[Global Visitor] --> Edge[Global CDN / Edge Routing]

    Edge --> R1[Region A Redirect Tier]
    Edge --> R2[Region B Redirect Tier]
    Edge --> R3[Region C Redirect Tier]

    R1 --> C1[(Regional Cache / Read Store)]
    R2 --> C2[(Regional Cache / Read Store)]
    R3 --> C3[(Regional Cache / Read Store)]

    Writer[Authoritative Write Region] --> Primary[(Primary Link Store)]
    Primary --> Outbox[Lifecycle Outbox]
    Outbox --> Stream[Global Lifecycle Stream]

    Stream --> C1
    Stream --> C2
    Stream --> C3
    Stream --> Purge[CDN Purge / Invalidation]
